          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva ni mulala ku avandu vandi vosi ukola uvwoni na aduuki kuhiola ku livunanyia lilala ku malago ga Yahova yalaga vugira kusaavira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maku yaho lwu uvwoni vwivwe vumanyikana, alahaana imburi isuveni vugira imbara, kigira uvwoni vwivwe vwa yakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaviika mukono gwigwe mulungi ku mutwi gwi imburi zana, na alagisinzira kolovega lwi ivaale wu uvwali, hi mitugu ji vihaanwa viukusambwa visinzirwaa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi aliina kedete chiche mu masahi gi imburi zana nokugavaka ku zinziga ziu uvwali. Alasundula masahi gatigaye ku lwaalo lwu uvwali vwi kihanwa chukusambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
