          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mundu woosi alaleeta kememe chi ligondi kuli kihanwa chiche chu uvwoni, kuduuka keve kisuveni vugira imbara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaviika mukono gwigwe mulungi ku mutwi gwacho ma akisinziri ku uvwali hi visiuviliru viu uvwoni visinzirwaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi aliina kedete chiche mumasaahi gu mutugu nukugavaka ku zinziga ziu uvwali. Alasundula amasahi gacho gatigaye goosi mu vwaaliru vwu uvwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku alatuliza mu itinya yayo yoosi, itinya itulizwa mu ligondi lisinziywi kigira kihanwa chi mirembe. Musaalisi alagisaamba harara ni vihaanwa vie viukulia vihaanwa ku Yahova. Nandio musaalisi alahaana kisiuviriru chu uvwoni vwu mundu kandi naye alasaamifwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.35"
            ]
          }
